  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Assessment of the needs and priorities of the JFDA (Part I)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project has two targets:&#x2022;	Assessment of the request for assistance by the Jordan Food and Drug Administration (JFDA) on training of food safety inspectors.&#x2022;	Improve the food safety situation by empowering food safety inspectors in the veterinary and phytosanitary organisations/fields, whilst clarifying the mandates of the different ministries and institutions involved in the scattered landscape of food control in Jordan.</narrative>
  </description>
